---
description: 
globs: **/*test*.py
alwaysApply: false
---
When testing, we don't care about testing code that isn't ours. We DO care about testing that our code connects properly to code that isn't ours, like other APIs.

Tests shouldn't be too trivial and should always have a reason for making it. Bias towards testing code *written in this repo* or writing tests that verify longer, multi-part workflows.
